    "detailed_description": "Halloween night is near, it is a time when the world of the living intertwines with the world of the nightmares. Mighty Warlock lurks for Irvinton citizens and only Pumpkinman, a mysterious and thrilling figure, can face him.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2564870/extras/1245d321feffae8529649fe27984c6d6.avif?t=1726160920\" width=610 height=360 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Made for fans of difficult challenges.<br></li><li>Fight with 10 different kind of monsters straight from the nightmares. Each kind of enemy has his unique style.<br></li><li>Defeat Warlock in epic boss fight.<br></li><li>Combat requires both skill and cleverness.<br></li><li>Improve character skills and overcome challenges more efficiently.<br></li><li>Travel to many atmospheric locations: graveyards, woods, crypts, and more!<br></li><li>Discover 20+ levels in various setting.</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2564870/extras/ed1987a7b1f31b548e0c8ab65da2bd87.poster.avif?t=1726160920\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2564870/extras/ed1987a7b1f31b548e0c8ab65da2bd87.webm?t=1726160920\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2564870/extras/ed1987a7b1f31b548e0c8ab65da2bd87.mp4?t=1726160920\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
